---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const cat = 'Jobs';
---

<BaseLayout title="Remote Data Science & Analytics Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home Data Career | RemoteWorkHub" description="Complete guide to remote data science and analytics jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote data professionals (Stripe, GitLab, Spotify, Airbnb), salary ranges by specialization from $55K-$250K+, essential skills (SQL, Python, statistics, ML), certifications, portfolio tips, interview prep, and how to break into data science with or without experience. Includes data analyst, data scientist, data engineer, ML engineer, analytics engineer, and BI analyst career paths.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-medium mb-2">{cat}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Remote Data Science & Analytics Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home Data Career | RemoteWorkHub</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">jobs</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">data-science</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">analytics</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">data</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">machine-learning</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">career</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">entry-level</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Complete guide to remote data science and analytics jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote data professionals (Stripe, GitLab, Spotify, Airbnb), salary ranges by specialization from $55K-$250K+, essential skills (SQL, Python, statistics, ML), certifications, portfolio tips, interview prep, and how to break into data science with or without experience. Includes data analyst, data scientist, data engineer, ML engineer, analytics engineer, and BI analyst career paths.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
